WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.900
A Liptako soolmẽ wã. Bãngr-gomdã yaa bũmb sẽn zĩnd pĩnd wẽndẽ wã, la d tõe n yeelame tɩ yaa vẽenega.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.968
Yʋʋm kobs a 19 soabã sɩngrẽ, Dori soolmẽ wã.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.346
Yaa neb a yiib n be tẽng zug: pe-kɩɩmb ne b rũmbu, la pʋʋsa rãmb ne b pʋtẽ.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.928
Tẽngã segd n dɩka a taaba.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.496
La daar a ye, piisã kẽe weoogẽ.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.596
Yãmb piisã rɩka maam!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.644
Yãmb pʋɩɩrã zãada tõnd sorã!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.168
Kẽng-y n yi be!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.508
Bãng-y tɩ rũnga yaa mam rẽnda masã.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.040
Sẽn yaa-a taoor soabã rɩka rũnda, la no-koeemdã paasdame.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.592
Ned ning sẽn ya kãsmã na n tigma a soaadbã.

00:01:41.592 --> 00:01:43.240
D pa le tõe n sak rẽ ye.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.960
D pʋʋsda Wẽnnaam n yaool n looge.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.220
Bɩ Wẽnnaam wilg yãmb sor la y sũyã.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:18.514
La yaa zabrã. Neb nins sẽn be Burkĩna wã zabda ne Gulmanse rãmbã.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.858
Bãng-y tɩ b baasame. M na n basame.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.080
Tãn-soab ning b sẽn yã wã kõome.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.900
Tẽnga rogame: Liptako soolmã.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.288
Rẽ n so t'a Liptako soolmã na n zĩnda be.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.032
Tãn-paal a ye n be tẽngã zugu.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:38.290
Dori lebga tẽn-kãsengã. Zĩ-gũudã sẽn be a masjiidã sɛɛgẽ wã, ra-kãsems n wat ne rũmsã sẽn yit yɩɩga.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:13.842
Rũndã-rũndã, Dori ket n yaa tẽn-kãsems sẽn be Burkina Faso soolmẽ wã. A kibarã ket n yaa to-to.
